
Challenge 071, Task #2: Trim Linked List (Raku)

Usage:
  raku ch-2.raku [-N[=Natural]] [-S[=UInt]]
  raku ch-2.raku [-N[=Natural]] [<elements> ...]
  
    -N[=Natural]        No. of the node to remove, counting from the list end
    -S[=UInt]           List size: elements will have values '1', '2', ..., 'S'
    [<elements> ...]    Explicit element values (strings), in order
